WEBVTT

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:12.360
"Kodomo no Omocha"

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.580
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:24.790
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.630
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.420
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.420
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
and your bitter face and bitter
feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.350
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.860
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:55.860
I may be a little jumbled,
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.870
I always feel Relax,

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:04.790
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:07.880
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:36.200
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.110
affiliated with Gekidan Komawari.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:41.120
My beloved Mama is a famous novelist,
who has even won the Aoki Laureate Prize.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:42.450
The chipmunk is Maro-chan.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:44.120
We're living the dream life
off of our royalties.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.000
My former boyfriend, Sagami Rei-kun.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.460
Right now, he's earnestly on the way
to becoming a fine manager.

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:50.460
Sana-chan, stay a little girl!

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:53.460
The mysterious white bat
straight man, Babbit.

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:56.130
Cheap by comparison.

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:58.180
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:00.800
Even so, right now, when I'm around him,
I'm relaxed for some reason.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:02.470
This is lame.

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:06.140
"Up To Today, and As Of Tomorrow"

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:13.820
We don't have much time,
so how about we get started?

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:16.150
There is only one reason why
we are gathuhed togethuh today,

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:20.160
and that is because of Sana-chan and...
uh... what was his name again? Um... uh...

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:21.160
Hayama?

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:24.410
R- right! Her relationship
with Hayama-kun.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.160
The public has been talking
about what's going on between them.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:30.500
I would like to hear what you have to say
in regards to the truth about them.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:33.590
That is why I had the idea to hold this
masked round-table discussion today.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:38.420
Nobody will know who is saying what,
so would you awl mind speaking the truth?

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:41.090
What do you mean, nobody will know!?
It's plain as day, ain't it!?

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:44.100
Well, let's start with what it was that got
their romance, if you'd call it that, started.

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:45.430
It would have to be that one thing.

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.430
Mm-hmm, I'm sure that was it.

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:51.770
Oh! You there, goils A and B,
you have some idea? Speak, speak.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:54.110
--I think it was that kiss that one time

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.110
--that started it.

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:56.110
K- kiss!?

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:59.360
You know what? If you drink
some juice, you might feel-

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.790
Y- you know what? Don't get
too angry about this, okay?

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:13.790
I- I really meant for nothing bad
to happen to you, see?

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:16.460
Uh, listen, they say that
if you drink some cold juice,

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:18.090
it will make you feel better,

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:21.130
so I just thought I could
help you to not feel so bad...

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:22.800
Ow, it's in my eyes.

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:25.140
Of course. It must sting, huh?

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.470
Oh, what should I do?

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:29.140
I'm sorry. I didn't mean for this to happen.

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:31.440
Hayama, how about we go wash your face?

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:34.440
It's going to get all sticky.
Come on, hurry.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.520
Okay? Hurry-

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:02.090
What did you just do!?

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:04.470
It's your own fault for
getting your face so close.

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:06.760
What do you mean by that!?

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:10.100
What's with you? Don't get all
worked up over something like this.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.930
You've got a 20-year-old boyfriend,

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:15.150
so something like this
shouldn't be anything to you.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:19.820
R- Rei-kun told me to reserve my first kiss
for him, and I had been saving my lips!

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:23.240
Oh, man! He kissed her,
and she's still in elementary school!

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.780
Not even I did anything like that.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:29.200
--Well, that settles it.
Still what on oith was he thinking?
--Hey, it doesn't matter. Are you done yet?

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:32.410
--A kiss! Seriously,
the grade school kids these days...
--Um...

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:34.000
Do you have any more?

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.750
Sneak, speak.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:42.130
Where could Tsuyoshi-kun have gone?
He should have said something to us.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:50.560
"Bottom of shoe"

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:50.560
What do you think you're doing!?

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:55.100
Y- you dirty letch!

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.100
It was right in front of my face.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:59.860
Oh, man! The problem only gets woise.

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.780
Doesn't this put
the show itself in jeopuhdy?

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:05.110
Are you sure you're not thinking
of something terribly wrong?

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:09.780
That's right! Hayama-kun is the problem,
and Sana-chan is the victim!

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:14.460
In fact, he even used make-out pictures
to blackmail teachers with!

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.790
But that has already been resolved,
hasn't it?

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:18.790
Still, the facts are facts!

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:21.800
That's right. Hayama-kun's charactuh
is what's important here.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.800
And I'm interested in these
make-out pitchuhs, too!

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.550
Sneak, speak.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:29.800
No time for that! Study! Study!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.140
Sana-chan, amazing!

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.060
Did you study at home, too?

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:38.060
Yeah, well, I got hypnotized by the math,
and fell asleep, so now I'm panicking.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:40.060
Guys, stand by me, okay? Okay? Okay?

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.400
It's okay, Sana-chan.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:44.070
We're all going to middle school together.
Let's hang together!

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:47.740
Mm-hmm! Thanks! That's real friendship!

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:50.160
Friendship! Isn't that
a nice word, Akito-kun?

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:52.740
Say, Akito-kun,
let's both help Sana-chan, too!

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:53.740
Doing what?

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:56.540
Why, helping her study, of course!

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:58.080
Starting with the small things,
and then building up-

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.080
Won't do any good.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.750
It's hopeless.

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:05.090
She can't do anything about her math,
no matter what we try.

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:08.090
Akito-kun, what did you just say?

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:09.090
I mean,

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.140
even if she stays after
and crams, or whatever,

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:13.760
at this point, it won't do any good.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:17.770
Hayama...

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:20.770
Sana-chan, don't you pay attention
to what Hayama said!

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.110
--Yeah! Yeah!

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.900
I thought Hayama-kun was on
pretty good terms with Sana-chan,

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:26.110
but that was cold, huh?

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.280
Hayama...

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.450
"Hayama, son, where are you going?!"

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:29.450
Hayama, are you...

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.740
What did you call me
out here to talk about?

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.410
Nothing much.

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:37.330
If you need my advice,
we can talk about anything.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:41.080
"Yaren 'sodan'..." Just kidding around.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:43.750
I- is that!?

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.420
A photograph.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:48.760
W- what!? But you gave
all the photos back, didn't you!?

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.930
There's still one more.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:56.770
There was one still left in my desk.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:07:01.440
Y- you can't... hey, you can't!
What are you planning to do with that!?

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.770
Unless you want it to get out,

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.110
you'll do as I say.

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:09.780
--Where could Akito-kun have gone?
Why would he-
--Why, Hayama!?

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:12.450
Mitsuya-sensei said you didn't
have any more reason to act out.

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:14.780
This is lame.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:17.790
It's lame that all of us have
to stay for after-school class.

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:21.620
What good will it do for us to cram
for a day or two, at most?

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.460
You can't do what you can't do.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:24.790
Hayama...

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.960
Cut this nonsensical crap out.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.380
Akito-kun is at it again!

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:32.720
Oh, man...

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.720
That's all you've been saying lately.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:38.390
Listen, about these make-out pitchuhs,
do any of you have any of them? Huh?

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:41.060
You can tell your big brothuh here, right?
Tell me, okay?

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.730
Oh! I knew it! Boy A!

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.730
Come on, show it to Big Brothuh!

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:47.730
Big Brother, aren't you
forgetting about your job?

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.400
Oh, awl right. Speak.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:54.070
Well, he did it to get us
out of those frightful review classes.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.070
That's right.

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:56.080
Right, right.

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:58.740
Hayama, why did you go back
to being a bad person!?

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.250
You said you didn't have any more pictures!

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.080
You lying, rice-pounding,
desert on the moon!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.420
Shut up! I never told any lies!

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:06.750
You dummy, dummy, dummy! I'm a
dummy-dummy for believing in you, too!

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:07.750
Let go of me, would you!?

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.420
Make-out!?

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:13.430
Let me see that picture!

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.430
Come on!

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:16.760
Yikes...

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:19.770
Come on! Come on!

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:24.400
I don't even have it!

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.360
What is this, Tanaka-sensei?

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.030
A- actually, I need to talk to you.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:38.700
What is it? I was just about to
confirm something very important.

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:42.080
I guess I don't have much choice.
So, what is it?

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.460
It doesn't matter what it is,

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.420
as long as I can change the subject
from the make-out picture...

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:49.090
Right! It's about the aptitude test!

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.090
What about it?

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:51.090
W-well...

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:54.630
Someone who has been left behind
for years won't be able to do anything

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.430
in just three days. Testing them won't-

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.720
That's right! I just remembered!

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:02.020
In short, as educators, our duty should
be to make the subjects understandable,

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:05.770
not to check the students with tests!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:08.110
You could say that... you could say that!

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:11.110
That is indeed a correct opinion.
But I cannot back off at this point.

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:12.780
--Please!
--Please!

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.070
Andoh-sensei!

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:17.070
We want to go to middle school
together with Sana-chan!

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:19.740
If you have to test us,
at least make it a little later!

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:22.790
We will all help take
care of Sana-chan's math!

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:24.080
On, you guys!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.460
You've got some snot coming out.

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:26.460
--Sensei!

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.130
--Andoh-sensei!

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:30.130
--Sensei!

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:34.720
I- I've become like the
despised teacher in a young adult drama...

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:37.380
I... I...

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:40.720
Sensei, we love you! Sensei!

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:44.810
Yes, this is ideal education! This is youth!

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:47.730
I became a teacher in the hopes
of living that scene.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:51.770
This is bad. This is bad. Isn't there some-
isn't there some way out of this?

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:56.860
I've got a secret plan!

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.860
"Complete reversal"

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.830
S- she's on fire...

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:05.580
Sensei, you see,
has actually just been waiting

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:08.420
to hear those words of friendship
from all of you.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:11.750
And so, I intentionally took
the role of the hated villain upon me.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.420
It really was hard on me.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:18.090
Everyone, value your friendships.
I will call off the test.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:19.430
--Yay!

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:21.100
Thank you, Andoh-sensei!

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:23.760
Wow, I'm saved!

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:27.430
--Thank goodness!
--Thank you, Sensei!

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:31.110
Hey, it turned out the way you wanted.
Hand over the photo.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:33.360
Hayama! Don't tell me you!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.690
Don't tell me you used the
make-out picture for my sake!

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:36.690
Not really.

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:41.030
Oh, isn't that kind of you!
Still, I'm very happy you did!

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:42.700
Awl right, it's ovuh!

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:45.040
Now, let me have a look at it.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.040
Sure enough, it's this one.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.210
How come this is of Limbo Sumire!?

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.630
"One moment please"

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.630
Just a minute, okay?

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:55.670
"Sana-chan's drawing song"

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.130
I know this is sudden,
but here's a Sana-chan drawing song.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.670
Get your paper and crayon ready!

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.720
♪ First there comes a mountain, and then, ♪

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.720
♪ water comes splashing down from it. ♪

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:02.050
♪ Get two cups ready, ♪

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.050
♪ and then add two handles. ♪

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.060
♪ Butterflies come flying in, ♪

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:08.060
♪ with tails growing out of their behinds. ♪

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:10.060
♪ Here a slope, there a slope, ups-a-daisy, ♪

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.060
♪ and draw in the eye like an arrow. ♪

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:14.060
♪ Let's draw one more arrow. ♪

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:16.070
♪ It's time for gym, so bring out
the vaulting boxes. ♪

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:18.070
♪ Stick a second one on top of it, ♪

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:20.400
♪ The letter "ku," the letter "ku,"
the letter "ku," hey! ♪

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.410
♪ Then we stick six beans on. ♪

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.410
♪ And now we've drawn Sana-chan! ♪

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.740
♪ Dance! Dance! Hey! Hey! Hey! ♪

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:29.830
♪ This is the Sana-chan drawing song! ♪

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:34.420
I thought that was going
to be the death of me.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:35.420
Now what!?

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:38.760
I refuse to acknowledge those two's
relationship over just this!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.090
Akito-kun and Sana-chan's
friendship is genuine.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:42.430
I won't acknowledge it!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.430
It's genuine!

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:44.760
--I won't acknowledge it!
--It's genuine!

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:49.430
--Um, hello, hello? Would you listen to me?

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.760
--I won't acknowledge it!
I won't acknowledge it!

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:48.430
--It's genuine! Whatever it
might not be, it is genuine!

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:49.430
--I won't acknowledge it!

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:53.100
Those two... those two...
those two's friendship...

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:57.270
"Eniuneg sti!" What was that?

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:03.030
It was "it's genuine!"

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:07.990
Those two... those two's friendship...
is one of love-love!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:11.000
Awl right, that gets to the heart of it!
Speak, speak!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:15.080
T- Tsuyoshi-kun does not
have a mother complex!

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:16.960
He just loves his mom, that's all!

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:20.670
A- Aya-chan...

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:25.010
Y- you don't mean... Aya-chan, don't tell me
that the boy you're in love with is...

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:27.680
I... I...

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:30.850
I love Tsuyoshi-kun!!

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.640
Is that right, Aya-chan!?

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:34.940
Aren't you the slow one?

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.400
"The two of them walk a thorny path"

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.400
A thorny path!

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:39.980
This certainly is a thorny path. Ow!

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.320
Aya-chan? Aya-chan?

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:43.650
Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:45.070
Over here, over here!

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:50.330
Wow, thanks, Aya-chan!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:53.660
Curry really is too spicy with
just the roux sauce, huh Aya-chan?

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:54.670
Mm-hmm.

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:56.000
What's wrong, Aya-chan?

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.130
To think we'd have to
sneak around like this.

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:01.010
How long is this going to go on?

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:03.670
I've had enough of this, myself.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:06.680
After all, I liked cleaning
and doing laundry from the start...

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:08.350
...and you, more than anything, Aya-chan...

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:10.010
Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:11.680
Oh my, Boy A...

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.680
That goes double for you, Girl B...

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:15.020
This is embarrassing...

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:17.020
I'm actually a little glad...

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:18.360
Hey, you two!

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:19.360
--Huh?
--Huh?

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.030
Don't you "huh" me!

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:25.030
Ah, so you two are the ones
who are totally in love-love! Geez!

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:27.700
Really, I'm the one who
should be embarrassed!

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:30.700
We're talking about Sana-chan here!
Sana-chan!

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:35.290
Even I, once called the divine
Big Brothuh Z, am really about to snap.

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:37.960
What are the grade school kids
these days thinking?

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:41.630
There, there, Big Brother Z, cheer up.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:44.920
Awl right. I am well aware
that you guys are in love-love.

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:48.300
Nevuh mind that, the issue here
is Sana-chan and Hayama.

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:49.640
From what I've hoid so far,

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:52.310
hasn't Hayama always been
one-sidedly pushing himself on her?

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:55.980
Which is why I spelled it out
for him clearly that one time.

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:58.310
What about you?

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:02.320
Is there something you're working hard at,
like Sana-chan is?

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.730
Oh.

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:05.650
Nope.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:08.360
Then you won't be a good match
for Sana-chan.

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:15.830
That's why Akito-kun started taking karate,
so he wouldn't be beaten out.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.000
Hayama-kun,

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:19.670
Chop!!

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:22.340
...is what it looks like,
but then, it's a butcher!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:29.090
Akito-kun, stop that! Stop that, I say!

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:31.720
Hayama-kun...

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:35.680
Why don't you take up karate?

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:40.690
As it happens, a friend of mine
is opening up a new branch dojo.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:45.650
He's looking for some students. What do
you think? Would you like to give it a try?

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:50.610
That's silly, Principal.

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:54.660
There's no way Akito-kun would do
anything that takes that kind of resolve.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:55.290
I'll do it.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:57.620
There, you see? Huh? You'll do it!?

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:00.000
Is that so, is that so?

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.290
Don't rub my head.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:06.380
Huh? Akito-kun, why? Why would you?

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:12.510
Ease your body into it,

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:14.680
keeping your head
directly above your hind end.

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:17.980
Keep your arm at your side,
make a tight fist, and twist as you...

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:20.690
Strike! Strike! Strike!

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:29.030
So that's why...

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:30.360
That's right.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:35.280
Still, Boy B did a pretty good job too,
during the distoibance ovuh that essay.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:39.290
Coverage of Kurata Misako-san's essay
had been growing ever more aggressive,

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:42.290
but as a result of a press conference
called last night by Kamura Naozumi,

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:45.630
who appears in the popular drama
"Anvil of Destruction" on Channel 108,

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:47.630
it appears to be
cooling off for the moment.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:50.050
And so, we now bring you
the press conference

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:53.970
--held by Kamura Naozumi-kun
a little past 9 o'clock last night.
--Kamura?

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:57.310
Up to now, I have kept everything
about my profile hidden,

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:59.640
but now, I would like to speak
a little concerning it.

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:02.850
Soon after I was born, I was abandoned
in front of a nursing home,

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:04.310
named Kamura Academy.

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:06.900
Kamura Academy- that's the home
that takes in children

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:07.980
that don't have any relatives.

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:10.990
It appears that I am half-westerner,
but I really do not know.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:15.320
W- what? Him, too? Hey...

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.990
Does this home have any connection

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.990
with the place that
took Sana-chan in for a month?

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:21.080
I won't say anything about Sana-chan.

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:25.670
I will say anything about myself, so please,
stop barging in on Sana-chan.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:28.670
I ask you to please leave Sana-chan alone.

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:31.340
--So, Naozumi-kun, you stayed with
Kamura Academy the whole time?
--Naozumi-kun...

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:33.930
Yes. That is where I grew up.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:35.260
Sana-chan...

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.930
Boy B, you're pretty hot for her too, huh?

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:41.810
Still, Sana-chan seems to think
of both you and Hayama

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.940
more as just friends than you'd think,
doesn't she?

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:48.730
The truth is, Sana-chan prefers
grown up men, doesn't she?

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:55.450
I mean, I got to throw Sana-chan
a lavish birthday party.

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:57.160
"Zen-chan and Sane-yank hip hop act"

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:58.620
--♪ Zen-chan... ♪
--♪ and Sane-yan's... ♪

00:16:58.620 --> 00:16:59.620
♪ ..hip hop act! ♪

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:01.620
♪ Sane-yan, been putting
too much weight on lately? ♪

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.620
♪ What about you, Zen-chan,
your teeth stick out too far! ♪

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:04.620
--♪ Chaka-poko, chaka-poko, ♪

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:06.290
--♪ chaka-poko-rin! ♪

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:07.290
What is this?

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:08.630
They're silly.

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:10.960
How can they dignify
putting on such a silly act?

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:12.970
Mother loves it! Let me join in!

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:15.970
So, Mayu-chan and Tomomi-chan
aren't coming after all?

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:16.970
I guess not.

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:19.300
But Kamura Naozumi-kun did come.

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:22.310
Mm-hmm. Oh, is he planning
to play his trumpet next?

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:24.310
Would you let me join in with you!

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:26.650
Oh, my! We are open to everyone!

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:28.310
Now we're the middle-aged squad!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.690
--You're the only middle-aged one here!

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:33.650
--♪ Chaka-poko, chaka-poko, ♪

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:34.610
--♪ chaka-poko-rin! ♪

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:36.280
--♪ Chaka-poko, chaka-poko, chaka-poko- ♪

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:37.280
Stop!!

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:38.620
Mayu-chan...

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:41.120
What kind of performance is that?
You're not out out to be pros.

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:45.120
"Not out out to be a pro"

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.620
We are amateurs, you see...

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:45.120
I'm a pro!

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:48.380
Just a minute!
Didn't I tell you to out this!?

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:54.300
As someone extremely close to Sana,
allow me to offer you this crucial hint.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:56.630
Ho, you're going to tell us something?

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:58.300
Yum! Yum!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.300
What was that?

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:02.760
Hey! It looks like you're having fun
without the main character!

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:04.310
I'm coming, too!

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:06.640
Before you do,
there's a telephone call for you.

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:07.980
For me?

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:10.310
Yes. From Kamura-kun.

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.860
Naozumi-kun?

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:15.990
Hey, Sana-chan! How's the party?

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:20.320
I'm at Kamura Academy right now.
Everyone else is here, too.

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:22.660
--Yay! Sana-chan!

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:25.290
Then, Naozumi-kun,
your plans every year are?

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:32.750
"Merry Christmas"

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:28.670
Mm-hmm. I spend Christmas Eve
at Kamura Academy.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:32.750
After all, this is my home,
and everyone is here waiting for me.

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:37.920
Anyhow, Sana-chan, we have
a present for you from all of us.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.930
W- what?

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:41.260
1, 2, 3...

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:44.470
--♪ Merry Christmas, ♪

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:47.270
--♪ we gather here tonight, ♪

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:50.600
--♪ filled with gratitude ♪

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:53.610
--♪ for the Lord's guidance. ♪

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:56.740
--♪ To those who are happy, ♪

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:59.610
--♪ and those who are sad, ♪

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:02.870
--♪ tonight we sing to you ♪

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:05.950
--♪ "Merry Christmas." ♪

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:10.960
--♪ Merry Christmas, we wish your heart. ♪

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:15.170
--♪ May this night ♪

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:18.300
--♪ be filled with hopes and dreams, ♪

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:21.300
--♪ and love for everyone ♪

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:24.300
--♪ born into this world. ♪

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:27.520
--♪ Tonight we wish you ♪

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:31.310
--♪ a merry Christmas. ♪

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:36.320
Naozumi-kun sure is a nice guy.
Much, much nicer than I thought.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:38.610
Boy B, you've got a one-pace lead, huh?

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:41.910
Easy! The night kept going on!

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:43.780
Ho, you're going to tell us about it?

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:47.620
Hayama...

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:49.500
What are you doing?

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:52.290
What is that thing!?

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:55.540
Well, you know... I'm not sure
what it is, but it's yours.

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:58.920
What?

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:01.300
A present?

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:02.300
Thanks!

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:03.300
S- sure...

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:06.640
Woo-hoo! A present from Hayama! Yahoo!

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:08.270
So, did you have fun today?

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:09.310
I guess so.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:12.600
Really? Good, good.

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:14.860
I...

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:58.270
She could have turned away
from that if she had wanted to...

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:01.280
S- Sana-chan! My Sana-chan!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.740
Is she your daughter!?

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:07.280
He did it again...

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:10.290
Somehow, I couldn't turn away...

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:13.910
Sometimes, Hayama's eyes
can paralyze others...

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:20.630
--Z, it'd be okay for me to tell about
when I was carrying on with them, right?

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:17.630
--Aya-chan...

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:18.630
--Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:19.800
--Whatever happens to Sana-chan

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:20.630
--and the others,

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:24.970
--We're talking about
who Sana-chan is close to, right?

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:22.630
--the two of us will always be together.

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:23.630
--Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:24.970
--Aya-chan...

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:26.130
--And speaking of being close,

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:30.970
--Tsuyoshi-kun...
--Aya-chan...

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:27.640
--lately, there haven't been any goils

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:28.970
--getting close to me.

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:30.970
--Say, does anyone know any pretty goils?

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:34.980
--Unduh the coicumstances, I can look past
some things. They can even be a bit olduh.

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:31.640
--Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:34.980
--Aya-chan, this is love-love...

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:36.980
--They seem to be
enjoying themselves, huh?
--Sure do.

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.310
Zenjiro-sensei!

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:39.310
--Sana-chan!

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:41.570
You think it's okay for me not to appear,
and for you to gab away about this,

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:42.980
that and the other!?

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:45.650
Give me more screen time!!

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:47.990
How did this happen!?

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:49.490
She's taking it out on the others, too.

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:51.490
Her punch gets passing marks, though.

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:55.830
Sagami Rei finally makes his appearance!
Finally... finally...

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:57.500
Hey, Rei-kun, what's that?

00:21:57.500 --> 00:21:59.500
This was just delivered.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:03.170
Ah! My middle school uniform has arrived!

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:05.260
Whoa, how cool!

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:08.010
Say, say, does it look good?
Does it look good?

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:10.180
--Look! Look! Look!
--Mine came, too.

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:13.180
We're really going to be
in middle school, huh?

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:17.270
And so, the round-table apparently
didn't reach any conclusions,

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:18.520
but starting next time, everyone-

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:22.190
-will be in middle school!
Ba-bing, za-boom, let's all hang in there!

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:38.960
It's all DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:41.790
When you sing this song, your worries will go

00:22:41.920 --> 00:22:43.880
Bye Bye Bye

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:46.550
Cuz your heart will be carefree,

00:22:46.720 --> 00:22:48.470
and your body will be healthy,

00:22:48.590 --> 00:22:50.340
so resolve when to give up

00:22:50.470 --> 00:22:52.300
Bye Bye Bye Bye

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:53.640
(Sing-ken-ken ken-ken)

00:22:53.640 --> 00:22:55.470
(Tidak apa-apa,
Nday kambay kambay)

00:22:55.470 --> 00:22:57.930
It's always the same old nonsense,

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:00.400
U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:02.980
(Mm? Could be you're fairly dumb...)

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:05.610
and then later comes the whimpering,

00:23:05.730 --> 00:23:08.150
KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:10.950
(Ah... it's fine, it's fine, it's fine)

00:23:10.950 --> 00:23:13.240
It's all crazy over there,

00:23:13.410 --> 00:23:15.160
it's all "waah!" over here,

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:18.500
and the whole Earth
is spinning the wrong way.

00:23:18.620 --> 00:23:22.330
So at this point now, yeah at this point now,

00:23:22.460 --> 00:23:26.630
you can laugh it away, excuse me, I must be going.

00:23:26.670 --> 00:23:28.550
DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:31.380
When you sing this song, your worries will go

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:33.300
Bye Bye Bye

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:36.140
Cuz you tried your MECHA-KUCHA best,

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:38.020
to PECHA-KUCHA out a "Hi,"

00:23:38.140 --> 00:23:39.980
so just keep going unlike this!

00:23:40.100 --> 00:23:41.850
Wai Wai Wai Wai

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:43.770
DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:23:43.900 --> 00:23:48.690
Once your lips touch, you can't change your mind.

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:51.400
Cuz your heart will be carefree,

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:53.280
and your body will be healthy,

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:55.240
so resolve when to give up

00:23:55.370 --> 00:23:58.830
Bye Bye Bye Bye

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:01.040
(Sing-ken-ken ken-ken,
Tidak apa-apa)

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:03.040
(Gwaenchansseumnida,
kwenchanayo)

00:24:03.120 --> 00:24:04.420
(Mou man tail)

00:24:07.840 --> 00:24:10.840
Sorry to keep you waiting.
As of next time...

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:12.590
In no time flat, Kurata Sana has turned 12,

00:24:12.590 --> 00:24:13.840
and become a first-year student
in middle school.

00:24:13.840 --> 00:24:16.850
Hayama, Tsuyoshi-kun, Hisae-chan,
Aya-chan, Mami-chan, Gomi,

00:24:16.850 --> 00:24:18.180
and everyone else is in middle school, too!

00:24:18.180 --> 00:24:21.520
And, who is my new friend
making her first appearance?

00:24:21.520 --> 00:24:23.520
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
episode 52,

00:24:23.520 --> 00:24:28.270
a tale of "what exciting new developments will
there be? With vocalist Shinohara Tomoe-chan,"

00:24:28.270 --> 00:24:31.860
"The Best Friend I Met In the Restroom"

00:24:31.860 --> 00:24:35.030
There's gonna be popping eyebrows
and bloody noses, too!
